{"text":"Your Article 25 says that all people are equally entitled to freedom of conscience and the right freely to profess, practice and propagate religion. In both our countries, in all countries, upholding this fundamental freedom is the responsibility of government, but it's also the responsibility of every person. In our lives, Michelle and I have been strengthened by our Christian faith. But there have been times where my faith has been questioned by people who don't know me, or they've said I'd adhere to a different religion, as if that were somehow a bad thing. Around the world, we've seen intolerance and violence and terror perpetrated by those who profess to be standing up for their faith, but in fact are betraying it.","words":[{"text":"Your","start":0.0,"end":1.24},{"text":"Article","start":1.24,"end":1.5},{"text":"25","start":1.5,"end":2.02},{"text":"says","start":2.02,"end":2.3},{"text":"that","start":2.3,"end":2.48},{"text":"all","start":2.48,"end":2.74},{"text":"people","start":2.74,"end":3.04},{"text":"are","start":3.04,"end":3.24},{"text":"equally","start":3.24,"end":3.74},{"text":"entitled","start":3.74,"end":4.18},{"text":"to","start":4.18,"end":4.46},{"text":"freedom","start":4.46,"end":4.72},{"text":"of","start":4.72,"end":4.94},{"text":"conscience","start":4.94,"end":5.36},{"text":"and","start":5.36,"end":6.56},{"text":"the","start":6.56,"end":6.66},{"text":"right","start":6.66,"end":6.82},{"text":"freely","start":6.82,"end":7.28},{"text":"to","start":7.28,"end":7.58},{"text":"profess","start":7.58,"end":7.96,"punct":","},{"text":"practice","start":8.5,"end":8.86},{"text":"and","start":8.86,"end":9.14},{"text":"propagate","start":9.14,"end":9.64},{"text":"religion","start":9.64,"end":9.98,"punct":"."},{"text":"In","start":12.1,"end":12.26},{"text":"both","start":12.26,"end":12.46},{"text":"our","start":12.46,"end":12.66},{"text":"countries","start":12.66,"end":13.06,"punct":","},{"text":"in","start":14.24,"end":14.52},{"text":"all","start":14.